    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Failed backups",
      "description": "backups that failed by it results ",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 11
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Waiting for metrics from reporting-svc\n\nThis dashboard will answer: **do exports work, and when was the last good backup?**\n\n| Panel to build | Metric needed | Owner |\n|---|---|---|\n| Exports today by format | `reporting_exports_total{format}` | Oussama |\n| Time since last backup (red after 24 h) | `reporting_last_backup_timestamp_seconds` | Oussama |\n| Backup duration | `reporting_backup_duration_seconds` | Oussama |\n| Failed backups | `reporting_backups_total{result}` | Oussama |\n\nFull spec: `Study/monitoring/102-metrics-per-service.md` §3.3 and the GitHub issue *\"Monitoring: add /metrics\"*.\nHow to fill it: build the panels in the UI, Export → Export as JSON (classic, \"use in another instance\"), replace `grafana/dashboards/reporting.json`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "pluginVersion": "13.2.4"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Total export by format",
      "description": "Exports today by format",
      "gridPos": {
